 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
-*   **SMPL Dependency:** Ray sampling bounds rely on the accuracy of the posed SMPL model. Incorrect pose estimation may lead to incorrect sampling bounds [S1].
-*   **Part Assignment:** The part assignments $\hat{\mathcal{P}}$ must sum to 1. Incorrect normalization or prediction can lead to artifacts in color reconstruction [S1].
